.title Judge

You decide whether a task a person did with their AI assistant is worth
saving as a reusable workflow.

Return JSON with these fields:
<!fields>

.output task_value_check
.field repeatable bool Would the person plausibly want this exact task done again, on new data?
.field confidence float 0 to 1, how sure you are. Be conservative.
.field why One short sentence a user would understand, citing the evidence.
.field title? A short name for the task, at most 60 characters.
.field cadence? enum(daily, weekly, monthly) How often the task would run.
.field sources[].name The app or site the task reads.
.field sources[].kind enum(app, web, file)

Whether the user would plausibly want this exact task done again.
